  <section class="ithv3-sec ithv3-sec--hero">
    <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true">
      <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" tabindex="-1">
        <source src="https://dev-website.ithena.app/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ecommerce-hero-parts-video.mp4" type="video/mp4">
      </video>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hero-in">
        <div class="hero-txt">
          <p class="eyebrow ld">ITHENA &middot; Blog</p>
          <h1 class="ld ld2"><span class="b">Field notes</span>from the connected factory</h1>
          <p class="lede ld ld3">What agentic AI, automation and service look like once they reach the plant floor - written by the people building ITHENA&rsquo;s platforms.</p>
        </div>
